ore  through boats  and increase my chance of infecting  countries that only have sea ports  such as the caribbean greenland  madagascar  now the infection really starts to take  hold  as you can see there was a massive  infection spike  now i wonder should i just  save my disease points  because a lot needs to be done in a  short space of time to really take  advantage  of this type of plague  let's pop these  and the infection is spreading quite  nicely throughout russia  just double checking  now there are points in this map where  it will be  impossible to infect with a traditional  plague  but i think it's getting close  to revealing why that isn't an issue  with this type of plague  let me just pop these final bubbles here  yes 88 disease points  should be enough  now  immediately select these and get all the  way  to drifting fermentation which is of  course very important  as you can see on the left hand side  that is an active ability  and because i've chosen drifting  fermentation  i can send my undead army  across the sea to previously unreachable  areas  now  i have slowed down time a little bit  because timing  is crucial at this point and there will  be a lot of pop-ups  to take care of  so as you can see  i can now command a small portion of  zombies to actually cross  water to reach  other cities and populated areas  which will cause havoc and spread  the infection even further gunshots in  the background there  like my zombies are doing their intended  purpose  which is always good  greenland isn't very infected  and i have to infect sweden as well  so the z-com project now that is  a very bad sign  i will need to overrun them  because they actually kill zombies they  are  a branch of the military designed for  dispatching my  minions which is never good  at all as you can see there is a lot of  zombie outbreak pop-ups that i need to  deal with right now  whilst still staying off the oh that's a  lot of problems  whilst still staying off the cure  now i'm just bolstering  the strength of my zombies now because  if they are to destroy the zcom stations  they need to have some more abilities  they need to be stronger  i'm just sending more to greenland  because the infection is  very slow in greenland and it also has a  zcom station so it really is  key that i get rid of greenland  as soon as possible there is another  zcom station  that i'm fairly confident will get  annihilated quite quickly  as you can see oh seven million  looks like that z-com station is going  to fall extremely quickly  now the usa and canada  seem to be infecting extremely slowly  regardless of the fact that i used  that medicine upgrade  but with a bit of luck they will  pick up a little bit because luckily  they do not have zeecom stations  as you can see the zcom station in  finland  has fallen and i'm just sending more  zombies  to greenland  just to make sure the z-com station  falls  i have sent quite a bit of zombies so  it should only be a matter of time  before that happens  and even though i am actually sending  zombies away from canada it seems to be  picking up  rather nicely and zcom is down  in greenland which is a very good  turn of events canada seems to be  exponentially getting affected  which is always good  cold wave in sweden i imagine that's  because  everyone is dead or undead  as the case may be  [Music]  i sometimes try humor but it rarely if  ever works  so it should only be a matter of time  before everyone  has succumbed to my cure  the cure has destroyed humanity  i hope you've all enjoyed this zombie  themed let's play  i hope to see you all again next time  and as always  i am the cure  you

